## Installation

Clone the project and install dependencies:

```bash
pnpm install
```

---

## Environment Variables

Create a `.env` file:

```env
PORT=3000
MONGO_URI=mongodb://localhost:27017/code-practice
```

---

## Development

Start the development server:

```bash
pnpm dev
```

The server will run on:

```text
http://localhost:3000
```

---

## Build

Compile TypeScript:

```bash
pnpm build
```

---

## Production

Run the compiled application:

```bash
pnpm start
```

---

## Formatting

Format the project using Prettier:

```bash
pnpm format
```

Check formatting without modifying files:

```bash
pnpm format:check
```

