## Core Principle

The main architectural principle of this project is:

> **Business logic should not depend on infrastructure details. Infrastructure should depend on business contracts.**

For example:

```text
CreateUserUseCase
       │
       ▼
IUserRepository
       ▲
       │
UserRepository
       │
       ▼
MongoDB
```

The use case knows **what it needs**, while the infrastructure decides **how that requirement is implemented**.
